---
import BaseLayout from "../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../styles/about-me.css";
---

	<BaseLayout title="About Me">
		<main class="about-page">

    <h1>About Me</h1>

    <section class="about-card">

      <p>
        I’m a self-taught developer focused on Python, data analysis, and building toward embedded systems and low-level engineering.
      </p>

      <p>
        I enjoy working with data, building small systems, and improving my understanding of how software and hardware interact.
      </p>

      <p>
        I’m currently preparing for college in Computer Science while continuing to build real-world projects and freelance experience.
      </p>

    </section>

    <section class="about-card">

      <h2>Interests</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Data analysis & visualization</li>
        <li>Python & automation</li>
        <li>Embedded systems (ESP32, Arduino)</li>
        <li>Low-level tools and reverse engineering (Ghidra interest)</li>
      </ul>

    </section>

    <section class="about-card">

      <h2>Current Focus</h2>
      <p>
        Building a stronger portfolio through real projects, improving technical fundamentals (DSA, Python),
        and exploring AI/data labeling work opportunities.
      </p>

    </section>

  </main>
		
	</BaseLayout>